cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "RoboSense"
abstract: >-
  Dynamic robotaxi routing framework that treats a centrally dispatched
  robotaxi fleet as drive-by sensors for urban traffic monitoring, combining
  a cell-transmission-model traffic state prediction with a rolling-horizon
  MILP that trades off travel time against spatiotemporal monitoring coverage.
